WEBVTT

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:04.900
VERION is building an anime knowledge competition using free quiz points.

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:08.802
Fans use those points in competitions and point-only predictions.

00:00:08.832 --> 00:00:12.693
This prototype has three stages: initial, licensed, and longer-term.

00:00:12.793 --> 00:00:17.087
Our planned initial offer is a three-thousand-yen cel-preservation support package.

00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:19.703
Supporters receive five random digital pieces.

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:23.013
Only material cleared for digital use is included.

00:00:23.043 --> 00:00:28.243
The image has nine spaces. The center starts visible, and users collect the other eight.

00:00:28.273 --> 00:00:33.793
Completing it displays the image in the collection, but gives no points, level, or tournament access.

00:00:33.823 --> 00:00:37.023
The pieces have no cash value and guarantee no prize.

00:00:37.053 --> 00:00:40.253
They are separate from future official IP cards.

00:00:40.353 --> 00:00:44.653
Competition points are free, never sold or bundled with purchases.

00:00:44.683 --> 00:00:48.363
They cannot be transferred or exchanged for cash or crypto.

00:00:48.393 --> 00:00:53.964
Users earn them by answering sponsor advertising quizzes. Correct answers can earn more.

00:00:54.064 --> 00:00:57.061
The prototype uses a one-question-per-screen quiz feed.

00:00:57.091 --> 00:01:02.531
Users answer, choose how many points to use, and compete through knowledge and strategy.

00:01:02.561 --> 00:01:06.881
We plan continuous access and ten-person leagues matched by skill.

00:01:06.911 --> 00:01:10.747
IP tournaments require rights agreements and country-specific legal review.

00:01:10.777 --> 00:01:15.817
Prize money comes only from sponsors, separate from user payments and VERION revenue.

00:01:15.917 --> 00:01:17.997
Each advertisement becomes a question.

00:01:18.027 --> 00:01:23.467
Sponsors can measure whether users reached it and how they answered, not just impressions.

00:01:23.497 --> 00:01:28.210
With consent and privacy safeguards, responses will be aggregated and de-identified.

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:33.817
We plan to provide trends, not identifiable histories. Their accuracy must be validated.

00:01:33.917 --> 00:01:37.197
After IP licensing, we plan official digital collection cards.

00:01:37.227 --> 00:01:42.267
Pricing, rarity, issue size, and uses will be agreed with rights holders.

00:01:42.297 --> 00:01:44.877
We would first consider non-cash exchange.

00:01:44.907 --> 00:01:50.175
Any paid trading needs rights-holder approval and a legal review in each country.

00:01:50.205 --> 00:01:54.761
We do not promise that cards can be resold or rise in price.

00:01:54.861 --> 00:01:59.370
Another planned feature lets users choose YES or NO with non-cash points.

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:03.160
Each question states its source, decision time, and invalidation rule.

00:02:03.190 --> 00:02:08.299
A real-money launch is undecided and requires local legal review and licenses.

00:02:08.399 --> 00:02:14.078
Current planned revenue is the support package and referral fees on attributed purchases.

00:02:14.108 --> 00:02:19.255
Management reports reserve sponsor funds for prizes. Financial reporting follows each contract.

00:02:19.285 --> 00:02:24.853
Card sales, data licensing, and cash-market fees are future possibilities, not current revenue.

00:02:24.883 --> 00:02:29.605
After validating human competition, AI could draft quizzes for licensed titles.

00:02:29.635 --> 00:02:33.489
People would review rights, facts, and translations before publication.

00:02:33.589 --> 00:02:38.294
Our planned defenses are licenses, patent filings, and lawful operating data.

00:02:38.324 --> 00:02:41.754
License acquisition and patent grants are not guaranteed.

00:02:41.784 --> 00:02:44.782
First, we validate support and point-based competition.

00:02:44.812 --> 00:02:49.052
Then we secure IP rights and add only legally permitted features.

00:02:49.082 --> 00:02:51.722
This is the product VERION is building.
